            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>What is Treatment Scope for Sessions?</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>If the user browsed any Menu page from the vendors in the Target Vendor Groups defined in the Experiments during the session, then the session is tagged as Treatment = True. Otherwise, False.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>If the test is not launched through Experiment, then it is always NULL.</run>
              </formatted-text>
