                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>The Treament Scope is defined by the Target Groups in the new DPS Experiment Tab. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>If the Order fulfil all the Conditions(e.g. Time/New Customer) and all the Vendor Filters(e.g. Vertical = &apos;Darkstores&apos;) , the Order is tagged as True. Otherwise, False.</run>
