                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>When you select &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>All</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>&apos;, the CVR shown is CVR2, which starts from Listing Page.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>When you select &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Vendor Target Group</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>&apos;, the CVR shown is CVR3, which starts from Menu Page, thus no mCVR2. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Please be aware that since users could visit multiple vendor pages, so one session could be matched to mupltiple Target Groups.</run>
